WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.134 --> 00:00:13.681
After lunch, Mom went outside to weed the garden.

2
00:00:13.682 --> 00:00:16.887
Dad went to the hardware store.

3
00:00:16.888 --> 00:00:20.475
Vinnie and Mandy quickly did the dishes.

4
00:00:20.476 --> 00:00:23.344
Then they ran up to the attic.

5
00:00:23.345 --> 00:00:29.606
"Our photo trips still feel like a dream to me," Mandy said.

6
00:00:29.607 --> 00:00:33.919
"Do you think anyone would believe us?" asked Vinnie.

7
00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:36.719
He opened the attic door.

8
00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.012
Mandy shook her head.

9
00:00:39.013 --> 00:00:44.766
"No, they would think we were crazy."

10
00:00:44.767 --> 00:00:48.020
Vinnie picked up the photo album.

11
00:00:48.021 --> 00:00:51.739
He opened to the picture of Greece.

12
00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:57.344
"I wonder if Jason won his race at the Olympics," he said.

13
00:00:57.345 --> 00:01:02.676
"Where are we going now?" Mandy asked.

14
00:01:02.677 --> 00:01:05.012
Vinnie turned the page.

15
00:01:05.013 --> 00:01:07.869
The next photo was puzzling.

16
00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:11.616
The old man was standing beside a fountain.

17
00:01:11.617 --> 00:01:15.882
Behind him, frogs were glowing.

18
00:01:15.883 --> 00:01:19.473
"Where is this?" asked Vinnie.

19
00:01:19.474 --> 00:01:23.670
"We'll soon find out!" Mandy replied.

20
00:01:23.671 --> 00:01:27.019
The light forced them to close their eyes.

21
00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:34.136
The children fell down the deep tunnel once again.

22
00:01:34.137 --> 00:01:38.414
This time they landed in a tree.

23
00:01:38.415 --> 00:01:43.672
"Something's tickling my arm," giggled Mandy.

24
00:01:43.673 --> 00:01:46.430
It was a small red apple.

25
00:01:46.431 --> 00:01:51.884
"Oh, Mandy, I think I'm going to—," began Vinnie.

26
00:01:51.885 --> 00:01:54.145
The tree branch broke.

27
00:01:54.146 --> 00:01:58.134
Vinnie and Mandy fell to the ground—hard.

28
00:01:58.135 --> 00:02:01.013
Apples fell all around them.

29
00:02:01.014 --> 00:02:06.679
Someone screamed "No!" in a high voice.

30
00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:09.626
The children turned around.

31
00:02:09.627 --> 00:02:13.616
An old man was stamping his feet angrily.

32
00:02:13.617 --> 00:02:17.343
"Look at what you have done!" he shouted.

33
00:02:17.344 --> 00:02:20.895
The children quickly jumped up.

34
00:02:20.896 --> 00:02:25.746
"Look!" Vinnie said, grabbing his sister's arm.

35
00:02:25.747 --> 00:02:30.401
All around them grew different kinds of fruits and vegetables.

36
00:02:30.402 --> 00:02:36.410
Pear and peach trees were next to pumpkins on the vine.

37
00:02:36.411 --> 00:02:40.766
"How many apples did you ruin?" the man cried.

38
00:02:40.767 --> 00:02:43.553
He looked around in a panic.

39
00:02:43.554 --> 00:02:46.605
"His Majesty will be most upset.

40
00:02:46.606 --> 00:02:48.764
He won't stand for this.

41
00:02:48.765 --> 00:02:50.805
No, he will not."

42
00:02:50.806 --> 00:02:55.484
"We're so sorry," Mandy said.

43
00:02:55.485 --> 00:03:01.076
"My poor garden!" the man cried. "Who are you?"

44
00:03:01.077 --> 00:03:04.473
"We're—," Vinnie began.

45
00:03:04.474 --> 00:03:07.187
The man held up his hand.

46
00:03:07.188 --> 00:03:09.757
"I don't care! Get out!

47
00:03:09.758 --> 00:03:13.607
Leave at once!" he shouted.

48
00:03:13.608 --> 00:03:17.388
The children looked around for a way out.

49
00:03:17.389 --> 00:03:20.493
They saw the most amazing sight.

50
00:03:20.494 --> 00:03:24.613
A fabulous palace stood right in front of them!

51
00:03:24.614 --> 00:03:29.615
"Wow!" the children said together.

52
00:03:29.616 --> 00:03:33.415
"Where are we?" Vinnie asked aloud.

53
00:03:33.416 --> 00:03:40.690
"You little monsters!" the old man said, ignoring Vinnie. "I should—"

54
00:03:40.691 --> 00:03:43.369
But he suddenly became quiet.

55
00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:45.878
He bowed his head.

56
00:03:45.879 --> 00:03:48.617
The children turned to look.

57
00:03:48.618 --> 00:03:52.806
A group of men and women walked toward them.

58
00:03:52.807 --> 00:03:55.822
A man in a feathered hat was in front.

59
00:03:55.823 --> 00:03:59.419
He wore white stockings and long robes.

60
00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:02.571
He carried a cane.

61
00:04:02.572 --> 00:04:06.140
Vinnie could tell he was very important.

62
00:04:06.141 --> 00:04:11.548
"You, gardener!" The man pointed his cane at the old man.

63
00:04:11.549 --> 00:04:14.343
"What have you done to my apples?"

64
00:04:14.344 --> 00:04:17.336
The old man was very nervous.

65
00:04:17.337 --> 00:04:21.342
All he could do was mumble.

66
00:04:21.343 --> 00:04:24.882
"Excuse me, sir," interrupted Mandy.

67
00:04:24.883 --> 00:04:27.090
"I can tell you what—"

68
00:04:27.091 --> 00:04:30.617
There was a loud gasp from the group.

69
00:04:30.618 --> 00:04:34.360
Dozens of eyes stared at the children angrily.

70
00:04:34.361 --> 00:04:42.586
"How dare you speak to the Sun King!" one man scolded.
